---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const phone = '+12815550199';
const phoneDisplay = '(281) 555-0199';
---
<Layout title="Pool Leak Detection in Spring, TX | Find & Fix Water Loss" description="Professional pool leak detection in Spring, TX. Locate equipment, plumbing, or shell leaks quickly and get clear repair options.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>Leak Detection</h1>
      <p>Find the source of water loss and stop it before the bill climbs.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:800px">
      <p>A pool that loses more water than normal evaporation is costing you money and stressing the equipment. We use proven methods to locate the leak and explain repair options clearly.</p>
      <h2>Detection Methods</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Pressure testing of plumbing lines</li>
        <li>Dye testing around fittings and returns</li>
        <li>Electronic listening equipment when needed</li>
        <li>Visual inspection of equipment pad and shell</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Next Steps</h2>
      <p>Once the source is identified, we provide a written estimate for the repair. Many equipment and fitting leaks can be fixed the same day.</p>
      <p style="margin-top:2rem"><a href={`tel:${phone}`} class="btn btn-primary">Schedule Leak Detection</a></p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
